  "guid": "com.hazelify.servertweaks",
  "name": "Server Tweaks - Discount SVM",
  "slug": "server-tweaks-discount-svm",
  "teaser": "A simple mod that contains some universal server config tweaks.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/7O1PVR4U1hjMuOVcdX8rd5DV7kGK2l0sZPpmeH4c.png",
  "downloads": 4024,
  "favourites_count": 2,
  "description": "<p>This mod allows enabling some of the universally popular features from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/236/server-value-modifier-svm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">popular Server Value Modifier</a>. It’s a deliberately small mod for those of us who don’t want everything SVM has.</p>\n<p>Please keep in mind that some wanted features are not in the mod yet. I have not had enough time to research and implement them.</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-2-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Image gallery</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Here is what the config utility looks like. Use it before you run the server.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/minihazel/ServerTweaksUI/blob/master/ServerTweaksUI_0EVJuOC8Rg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"alt text\" /></p></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Logging</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Enable Full Logging</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Enable full logging in the server console</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Hideout</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Global Construction Time</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Control how fast construction is</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove Restrictions</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Remove all cost for constructing</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Raids</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Enable Extended Duration</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether <code>Extra Exfiltration Time</code> should be enabled</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Extra Exfiltration Time</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Extend every raid by X amount of minutes</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open Standard Exfils</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Open all the exfils available to your character (does not affect paid/coop)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cost for Coop Exfiltration</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Set how much coop exfils cost (if <code>Use Paid Coop Exfiltration</code> is enabled)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use Paid Coop Exfiltration</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Convert coop exfils to paid exfils</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Inventory</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Weighted Armbands</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Allow adjusting the weight of armbands (easy way for no weight)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Armband Weight</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Set the weight of all armbands, if using weighted armbands</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lootable Melee</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Allow looting melee from bots</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Master Key</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether <code>Lose Items on Death</code> is enabled</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lose Items on Death</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Adjust what on your character can be lost on death</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Traders</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>All Clothing is Free</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Make the available clothing free of charge and available at level 1</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Flea Market</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Unlock Flea at Level 1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether to unlock the Flea Market on level 1.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Insurance</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Insurance on Labs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Enable insurance on Laboratory</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Guaranteed Return for Prapor</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether Prapor’s insurance is guaranteed to return</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Guaranteed Return for Therapist</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether Therapist’s insurance is guaranteed to return</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insurance Max Storage Time</li>\n</ul>\n<p>How long insurance can be stored before going MIA</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When Should Insurance Return</li>\n</ul>\n<p>How long until insurance can return</p></div></div></div>\n",
